      en: ["Protects the slopes of the Bolaven Plateau", "Home to the famous Tad Fane waterfall", "Habitat for endangered Malayan sun bears", "High density of endemic butterfly species", "Fights against the expansion of coffee farms", "Offers breathtaking nature trekking trails"]
